#: ../../getting_started/additional/logback.rst:779
msgid "Audit logs"
msgstr "Journaux d'audit"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/logback.rst:781
msgid ""
"To set up CEF/SIEM auditing export, add the below appender above or below"
" the other appenders in the logback.xml configuration file:"
msgstr "Pour configurer l'export d'audit CEF/SIEM, ajoutez l'appender ci-dessous au-dessus ou en dessous des autres appenders dans le fichier de configuration logback.xml :"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/logback.rst:783
#, python-brace-format, python-format
msgid ""
"  <appender name=\"AUDIT\" "
"class=\"ch.qos.logback.core.rolling.RollingFileAppender\">\n"
"      <file>/var/log/morpheus/morpheus-ui/audit.log</file>\n"
"      <rollingPolicy "
"class=\"ch.qos.logback.core.rolling.SizeAndTimeBasedRollingPolicy\">\n"
"          <fileNamePattern>audit.%d{yyyy-MM-dd}.%i.log</fileNamePattern>\n"
"            <maxFileSize>50MB</maxFileSize>\n"
"            <maxHistory>30</maxHistory>\n"
"      </rollingPolicy>\n"
"      <encoder>\n"
"          <pattern>[%d] [%thread] %-5level %logger{15} - %maskedMsg "
"%n</pattern>\n"
"      </encoder>\n"
"  </appender>\n"
"\n"
"\n"
".. note:: ``maxFileSize`` and ``maxHistory`` values can be updated as "
"needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/additional/logback.rst:800
msgid ""
"Add the below logger above or below the other loggers in the logback.xml "
"configuration file (make sure it is below, not above, the appender from "
"the previous step or an error will occur):"
msgstr "Ajoutez le logger ci-dessous au-dessus ou en dessous des autres loggers dans le fichier de configuration logback.xml (assurez-vous qu'il est en dessous, et non au-dessus, de l'appender de l'étape précédente, sinon une erreur se produira) :"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/logback.rst:802
msgid ""
"<logger name=\"com.morpheus.AuditLogService\" level=\"INFO\" "
"additivity=\"false\">\n"
"    <appender-ref ref=\"AUDIT\" />\n"
"</logger>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/additional/logback.rst:808
msgid ""
"Once you have done this, you need to restart the |morpheus| Application "
"server:"
msgstr "Une fois cela fait, vous devez redémarrer le serveur d'application |morpheus| :"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/logback.rst:810
msgid "morpheus-ctl stop morpheus-ui"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/additional/logback.rst:814
msgid "Please be aware this will stop the web interface for |morpheus|."
msgstr "Veuillez noter que cela arrêtera l'interface web pour |morpheus|."

#: ../../getting_started/additional/logback.rst:816
msgid ""
"Once the service has stopped enter the following at the xml prompt to "
"restart (if the service does not stop, replace stop with graceful-kill "
"and retry)"
msgstr "Une fois le service arrêté, saisissez ce qui suit à l'invite xml pour redémarrer (si le service ne s'arrête pas, remplacez stop par graceful-kill et réessayez)"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/logback.rst:818
msgid "morpheus-ctl start morpheus-ui"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/additional/logback.rst:822
msgid "To know when the UI is up and running you can run the following command"
msgstr "Pour savoir quand l'interface est opérationnelle, vous pouvez exécuter la commande suivante"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/logback.rst:824
msgid "morpheus-ctl tail morpheus-ui"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/additional/logback.rst:828
msgid ""
"Once you see the ASCI art show up you will be able to log back into the "
"User Interface. A new audit file will have been created called audit.log "
"and will found in the default |morpheus| log path which is "
"``/var/log/morpheus/morpheus-ui/``"
msgstr "Une fois que vous voyez l'art ASCII apparaître, vous pourrez vous reconnecter à l'interface utilisateur. Un nouveau fichier d'audit appelé audit.log aura été créé et se trouvera dans le chemin de journal par défaut de |morpheus|, soit ``/var/log/morpheus/morpheus-ui/``"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/logback.rst:830
msgid ""
"This is only an example and other configurations are possible, such as "
"creating an appender definition for your SIEM audit database product."
msgstr "Il s'agit uniquement d'un exemple et d'autres configurations sont possibles, comme la création d'une définition d'appender pour votre produit de base de données d'audit SIEM."

#: ../../getting_started/additional/ipv6.rst:2
msgid "IPv6"
msgstr "IPv6"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/ipv6.rst:7
msgid ""
"There may be situations where instances only have IPv6 routing available."
"  |morpheus| fully supports IPv6 for the appliance and agent comms."
msgstr "Il peut arriver que des instances n'aient accès qu'au routage IPv6.  |morpheus| prend entièrement en charge IPv6 pour l'appliance et les communications des agents."

#: ../../getting_started/additional/ipv6.rst:9
msgid ""
"To enable IPv6 listener on the |morpheus| appliance, you must modify the "
"NGINX listeners."
msgstr "Pour activer l'écoute IPv6 sur l'appliance |morpheus|, vous devez modifier les écouteurs NGINX."

#: ../../getting_started/additional/ipv6.rst:12
msgid "Configuring NGINX Listeners"
msgstr "Configuration des écouteurs NGINX"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/ipv6.rst:13
msgid ""
"Confirm IPv6 is enabled and IP address is applied within the Morpheus "
"underlying OS."
msgstr "Confirmez qu'IPv6 est activé et que l'adresse IP est appliquée dans le système d'exploitation sous-jacent Morpheus."

#: ../../getting_started/additional/ipv6.rst:15
msgid ""
"Modify the ``/opt/morpheus/embedded/nginx/conf/sites-"
"available/morpheus.conf`` file, and add the following listerning under "
"the server block at the top:"
msgstr "Modifiez le fichier ``/opt/morpheus/embedded/nginx/conf/sites-available/morpheus.conf`` et ajoutez l'écoute suivante sous le bloc server en haut :"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/ipv6.rst:17
msgid "listen [::]:80;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/additional/ipv6.rst:21
msgid ""
"Modify the ``/opt/morpheus/embedded/nginx/conf/sites-available/morpheus-"
"ssl.conf`` file, and add the following listerning under the server block "
"at the top:"
msgstr "Modifiez le fichier ``/opt/morpheus/embedded/nginx/conf/sites-available/morpheus-ssl.conf`` et ajoutez l'écoute suivante sous le bloc server en haut :"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/ipv6.rst:23
msgid "listen [::]:443 ssl;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/additional/ipv6.rst:27
msgid "Restart the NGINX service:"
msgstr "Redémarrez le service NGINX :"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/ipv6.rst:29
msgid ""
"morpheus-ctl restart nginx\n"
"\n"
"ok: run: nginx: (pid 47868) 0s"
msgstr ""

#: ../../getting_started/additional/ipv6.rst:35
msgid ""
"The site should now be resolvable via IPv6. To test you should be able to"
" do the following:"
msgstr "Le site devrait maintenant être résolvable via IPv6. Pour tester, vous devriez pouvoir faire ce qui suit :"

#: ../../getting_started/additional/ipv6.rst:37
msgid ""
"curl -k -6 https://[<IPv6 Address>]/ping\n"
"\n"
"MORPHEUS PING"
msgstr ""

